| Filename | Overview |
|----------|----------|
| crates/core/src/ipns/name.rs | New name codec: base36 CIDv1 libp2p-key encode/decode, strict parse with canonical round-trip check, self-tested. Algorithm is correct and the O(n²) guard works. |
| crates/core/src/ipns/record.rs | New IPNS V2 record: sign/verify/marshal/unmarshal. Verify chain is correct. Drop impl zeroizes f.raw but leaves FieldValue::Bytes payload buffers un-zeroized. |
| crates/core/src/payload/pointer.rs | New pointer payload: seal/open with owner ECDSA signature inside det-CBOR. Sign-then-seal order correct, AAD scope binding correct, error classification precise. |
| crates/core/src/payload/mailbox.rs | New mailbox payload: HPKE-seal with sender sig inside. Logic is sound. senderSig length validation absent — wrong-length maps to IdentitySignatureInvalid (Trust) while pointer.rs maps wrong-length to InvalidFieldLength (Malformed). |
